<h2 id="wd-80e363b8" class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-custom-width">From a small hobby to own chain of stores​</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"fdd0cbb9-a28d-4b11-a267-2669582a383c","displayWidth":"custom","customWidth":"580","displayWidthTablet":"full-width"} -->
<p id="wd-fdd0cbb9" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-custom-width">A wonderful serenity has taken possession of my entire soul, like these sweet mornings of spring which I enjoy with my whole heart. I am alone, and feel the charm of existence in this spot, which was created for the bliss of souls like mine.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"68901351-adc2-4924-b97f-6eab7a400c20","displayWidth":"custom","customWidth":"580","displayWidthTablet":"full-width"} -->
<p id="wd-68901351" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-custom-width">When, while the lovely valley teems with vapour around me, and the meridian sun strikes the upper surface of the impenetrable foliage of my trees.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/column -->

<!-- wp:wd/column {"blockId":"90f2c7f4-69a2-4461-93ca-baabf58b657e","adjacentCount":2,"blocksGap":30,"adjacentCountTablet":1,"colWidthTablet":100} -->
